@model MyVoltage.Models.OperationalModels.D01_Leads.D01_LeadsModels.D01_Leads_SnapshotsModel
@inject MyVoltage.Services.OperationalProvider opProv;
@using MyVoltage.Extensions;
@{
    ViewData["Title"] = $"{MyVoltage.Data.SecureAreaEnum.D01_Leads_Snapshots.GetDescription()}";
}
<div id="loaderContent" class="loader-overlay-content">
    <div class="loader">
        <div class="text-orange text-center">
            <i class="fas fa-spinner fa-spin fa-2x"></i>&nbsp;Loading...
        </div>
    </div>
</div>
<div class="row col-12 mt-md-2">
    <table class="table table-responsive-xl table-striped table-hover">
        <thead>
            <tr>
                <th scope="col">Snapshot Date</th>
                <th scope="col"></th>
            </tr>
        </thead>
        <tbody>
            @foreach (var item in Model.D01_Leads_SnapshotsItems)
            {
                <tr>
                    <td scope="col">@item.SnapshotDate.ToDateAndTimeShort()</td>
                    <td scope="col">
                        <a target="_blank" class="btn btn-sm btn-outline-primary-sm" href="/operational/D01_Leads/D01_Leads_Snapshots_Download/@item.ID"><i class="fas fa-file-excel"></i>&nbsp;Download</a>
                    </td>
                </tr>
            }
        </tbody>
    </table>
</div>

<script type="text/javascript">
</script>